    "objectives": "Aim: deliver complete, checkable MEP asset data at handover instead of paper O&M binders.",
    "aimAndScope": "Aim: deliver complete, checkable MEP asset data at handover instead of paper O&M binders.",
    "benefits": "Shorter mobilisation of facility operations; no manual re-keying of asset data.",
    "limitations": "Spare parts and resource lists are not covered in this version.",
